Purpose: Form history ignores the container (userContextId): a value typed in one container is suggested in every container. Add a userContextId column (schema version 6; older rows belong to the default container, and a newer database that lacks the column gets it on a downgrade), take it into account when looking up, bumping, removing and autocompleting entries, and let FormHistoryParent pass the container of the page when the new pref browser.formfill.isolate_by_user_context is true (default false, so Firefox is unchanged). Upstreamable: yes, behind the pref.
Test: MOZCONFIG=swell/mozconfig ./mach test toolkit/components/satchel/test/unit; ./mach test swell/tests/app/isolation/browser/browser_form_history.js --headless

